## Unused menu videos / archives (the game only uses Muted_Voidheart.webm)
assets/bg/*.mp4
assets/bg/*.zip
assets/bg/Voidheart.webm

## Unused Tiled map drafts (runtime map is tiled/main-map.tmx)
assets/tiled/main-map2.tmx
assets/tiled/new.tmx
assets/tiled/newnew.tmx
assets/tiled/newnewnew.tmx
assets/tiled/newnewnew-main.tmx
assets/tiled/test.tmx

